==="Do not return yet to the heavens, just a little longer."{{subst:void|<!--104061017-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Loyal Guard:''' "One eye of hers sees glory. The other sees corpses."
:'''Kind Scholar:''' "And yet, she cherishes the name of glory more than fear and death..."
:'''Romantic Poet:''' "Ah, as they say: the coward died a thousand times before his end."
:'''Erratic Priest:''' "But the brave face death but once, which gods stand witness."
:'''Helektra:''' On the eve of war, we sang our hymns, and set our sights to sail beyond the stars...
:'''Helektra:''' The legions will climb aboard the beast, riding it like currents across the cosmos.
:'''Helektra:''' Planets after planets flew the flags of her crown. Realm after realm was ignited by her flames of war.
:'''Helektra:''' As the final resistance fell silent, a vast empire rose from among the stars and this small pond at last embraced prosperity and peace.
:'''Helektra:''' That's how the story ends. Tell me, visitor in this dream, did you enjoy the show?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's not the right ending.
::'''Helektra:''' After all, beneath that still surface lie the bones of countless dead...
::The fantasy ends here.
::'''Helektra:''' Yes... just fake bubbles glinting on the surface of poured wine...
::I don't know...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The fantasy ends here.
::'''Helektra:''' Yes... just fake bubbles glinting on the surface of poured wine...
::I don't know...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't know...
:'''Helektra:''' Not sure which way to swim? It's okay...
:'''Helektra:''' It's time for me to wake up from this drunken dream.
:{{tx}}
:'''Enthusiastic Citizen:''' Look! The monarch herself has taken her seat!
:'''Kind Citizen:''' Hear that? The court sings her praises!
:'''Excited Citizen:''' Come! Join us and praise her glory!
{{Dialogue End}}

==="Let not the wind claim you."{{subst:void|<!--104061018-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Cerydra:''' People once cheered for my ascension... and now they cheer for my fall...
:'''Cerydra:''' The cosmos... the battlefield that I cannot reach...
:'''Helektra:''' Before the sovereign's conquest reached its end, her life and ambition had already been swallowed by the deep sea.
:'''Helektra:''' This... is the true ending. Her grand designs torn apart by the blade, her regal robes soaked in golden blood...
:'''Helektra:''' And the one who struck her down...
:'''Helektra:''' The one who struck her down...
:'''Helektra:''' ...
:'''Helektra:''' ...was her most loyal Gladius.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You... killed her?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why...
:'''Helektra:''' I... don't need to explain myself. A fish in a pond has no hope against the surge of fate.
:{{tx}}
